        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Johnny, a kid in dire need of a Halloween costume, has to make do with whatever he can throw together using household supplies. Once you have your costume, out into the real world you go for some trick-or-treating! But this isn't your average night in suburbia... many strange things are afoot, and it's up to you to solve the puzzles if you want to enjoy all the delicious Halloween candies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.poster.avif?t=1759334881\" width=500 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.webm?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.mp4?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-or-Treat Adventure features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory items to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to interact with around an insane neighborhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror movie and pop-culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of evil to battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan (yeah, we were just as surprised as you are that he agreed to do a cameo!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more can be found in this big Halloweeny tale inspired by the classic point-&amp;-click adventure games of yesteryear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Halloween! 🎃</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.poster.avif?t=1759334881\" width=450 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.webm?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.mp4?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Johnny, a kid in dire need of a Halloween costume, has to make do with whatever he can throw together using household supplies. Once you have your costume, out into the real world you go for some trick-or-treating! But this isn't your average night in suburbia... many strange things are afoot, and it's up to you to solve the puzzles if you want to enjoy all the delicious Halloween candies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.poster.avif?t=1759334881\" width=500 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.webm?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/5d002fb777fa4e37e005eb48ba90e068.mp4?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trick-or-Treat Adventure features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide variety of puzzles to solve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory items to combine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to interact with around an insane neighborhood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror movie and pop-culture references</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-style pixel art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The forces of evil to battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements galore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satan (yeah, we were just as surprised as you are that he agreed to do a cameo!)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All this and more can be found in this big Halloweeny tale inspired by the classic point-&amp;-click adventure games of yesteryear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Happy Halloween! 🎃</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.poster.avif?t=1759334881\" width=450 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.webm?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867270/extras/623cbed87790bea5e1cc8a141ceb9ccc.mp4?t=1759334881\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A nostalgic Halloween retro point-&amp;-click adventure game. You must help Little Johnny put a Halloween costume together, go trick-or-treating for all the candies, and defeat the forces of evil!",
        "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
        "reviews": "“I did not expect SOOOOOOOOOOO MUCHHHHH this is amazing humor and darkness in one pixelated point-n-click!”<br />\r\n5/5 – VolknerBat<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“AWSOME, GREAT! I've always liked point 'n click adventures. So many jokes I needed an extra hour 'cause I laughed so much”<br />\r\n5/5 – ThunderEagle<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“One of the most... professional and polished games I ever played. The humor in the script is absolutely hilarious. Reminds me a little of Maniac Mansion (Geeze I'm old). Fantastic in every way... and it takes all the other 'retro games' and flushes them down the toilet.”<br />\r\n5/5 – RedEye<br />\r\n",
